<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Talbots cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Talbots cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it cut its rating on Talbots Inc to market perform from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Goldman said it raised its rating on AnnTaylor Stores Corp to market perform from underperform.</p>
<p>-- Talbots shares were down 1-1/4 at 27-1/2 while AnnTaylor was down 3/8 at 19-5/8.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
